        {
          "source": "spec",
          "quote": "PR1 with `on_board: no` ... all four pins (`VCC`, `SDA`, `SCL`, `GND`) typed `free` — i.e., it is not connected to any net in this design.",
        }
      ],
      "impact": "The board provides a powered LiDAR connection on the I2C bus, contrary to the specified unwired design. If a LiDAR is connected, it becomes an additional active bus device and changes the sensor interface and water-level sensing capability.",
      "confidence": 0.88
    }
  ],
  "summary": "The schematic wires the LiDAR interface to power, ground, and the I2C bus, while the specification explicitly describes the LiDAR as off-board and unwired."
}

